---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Professional Indemnity Insurance Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="Professional indemnity insurance in Cambodia protects businesses and professionals against claims of negligence, errors or omissions in their services."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href="/general-insurance-in-cambodia/">General Insurance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Professional Indemnity</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">General Insurance &bull; Private Insurance</p>
      <h1>Professional Indemnity Insurance</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">When clients rely on your professional advice, expertise or services, an error can become a financial claim. Professional Indemnity Insurance protects businesses and professionals against claims alleging negligence, mistakes, omissions or a failure to deliver professional services as expected.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Professional Indemnity</p>
        <h2>A claim doesn't always mean you did something wrong</h2>
        <p>A dissatisfied client may still allege that your advice, design, recommendation or work caused them a financial loss, and defending that allegation can involve significant legal costs even when the claim is ultimately unsuccessful.</p>
        <p>Professional Indemnity is particularly relevant to consultants, architects, engineers, accountants, IT and technology companies, agencies and other businesses whose clients depend on their specialist knowledge or professional services. Cover can include eligible legal defence costs, settlements and compensation arising from insured claims, subject to the terms and limits of the policy.</p>
        <p>We analyse the specific nature of your professional activities, responsibilities and contractual commitments to identify potential liability exposures. Drawing on our technical expertise, we recommend insurance solutions aligned with the scope of your services and the financial consequences of potential claims.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Free Quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>Who needs it</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Consultants</li>
          <li>Architects &amp; Engineers</li>
          <li>Accountants</li>
          <li>IT &amp; Technology Companies</li>
          <li>Agencies</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free insurance quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your business. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential: your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your business and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
